        "text_preview": "But insofar as the Central Amendment Act reduces the punishment for an offence punishable under Section 16(1)(a) of the Fazru vs State on 21 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/77938221/\n2 Act, there is no reason why the"
