        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. In the aforesaid matter accused appellants were convicted under section 7/16 of the Prevention of Adulteration Act for simple imprisonment for a period of six months along with a fine of Rs.1,000/-\neach, for a fine of Rs.2,000/-respectiv"
      },
      {
