        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Apex Court, after taking into consideration the provisions of section 52 containing the punishment clause in the newly enacted Food Safety and Standards Act, converted the sentence of appellant No.2 from three months of simple imprisonm"
      },
      {
