        "text_preview": "In Section 51 of the Act of 2006, penalty for selling/ storing substandard articles is prescribed,\nwhich is as under:-\n\"51. Penalty for sub-standards food.-Any person who whether by himself or by any other person on his behalf manufactures "
      },
